      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "‘Do’t. The letter\nThat I have sent her, by her own command\nShall give thee opportunity.’ O damn’d paper,\nBlack as the ink that’s on thee! Senseless bauble,\nArt thou a fedary for this act, and look’st\nSo virgin-like without? Lo, here she comes.",
